                  "description_html": "<h4>\n Job Description\n</h4>\n<h3>\n Overview\n</h3>\n<p>\n AtkinsR&eacute;alis is one of Canada's largest private sector nuclear engineering grou…",
                  "top_employer_awards": [
                    "https://www.canadastop100.com/montreal"
